{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"lane-sales","type":"group","x":15,"y":457,"width":11465,"height":295,"color":"5","label":"PIC · SALES"},
		{"id":"lane-purchasing","type":"group","x":15,"y":767,"width":11465,"height":295,"color":"2","label":"PIC · PURCHASING"},
		{"id":"lane-owner","type":"group","x":15,"y":1077,"width":11465,"height":295,"color":"6","label":"PIC · OWNER"},
		{"id":"lane-admin","type":"group","x":15,"y":1387,"width":11465,"height":295,"color":"#438FBD","label":"PIC · ADMIN"},
		{"id":"lane-finance","type":"group","x":15,"y":1697,"width":11465,"height":295,"color":"1","label":"PIC · FINANCE"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# PROSES BISNIS PPP — SATU STEP, SATU PIC\n### PT Prima Putra Perkasa · Alur trading / general supplier\nBaca nomor 01 → 27 dari kiri ke kanan. Posisi **baris** menunjukkan PIC; **panah** menunjukkan serah terima tugas.\n**ERP = ERP internal PPP.** Nama modul/fitur sengaja tidak diasumsikan.","x":20,"y":-470,"width":4700,"height":295,"color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"howto","type":"text","text":"## Cara membaca\n- **Satu kotak = satu pemilik tindakan dan satu output.**\n- Jika Owner juga melakukan sales, ia menjalankan **peran Sales** pada kotak Sales.\n- Customer adalah pihak eksternal; **Sales** yang bertanggung jawab mencatat respons customer.\n- Cabang stok siap dan metode pembayaran supplier tidak selalu melewati semua kotak.\n- Dokumen dicatat di ERP internal sesuai fitur yang tersedia.","x":4830,"y":-470,"width":3620,"height":295,"color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"status","type":"text","text":"## Status penggunaan\nDraft revisi untuk review internal. Pembagian tugas disusun dari diskusi sebelumnya, **belum dinyatakan SOP resmi**. Putuskan khususnya: otorisasi pembelian, proses pengiriman sebelum customer PO, kontrol petty cash, dan termin.","x":8560,"y":-470,"width":2880,"height":295,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"phase-1","type":"text","text":"## A · AKUISISI & RFQ\nNomor 01–03","x":400,"y":80,"width":1130,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"phase-2","type":"text","text":"## B · HARGA & QUOTATION\nNomor 04–09","x":1600,"y":80,"width":2330,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"phase-3","type":"text","text":"## C · CUSTOMER PO & ORDER\nNomor 10–13","x":4000,"y":80,"width":1530,"height":160,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"phase-4","type":"text","text":"## D · PENGADAAN & KIRIM\nNomor 14–20","x":5600,"y":80,"width":2730,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"phase-5","type":"text","text":"## E · INVOICE\nNomor 21–23","x":8400,"y":80,"width":1130,"height":160,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"phase-6","type":"text","text":"## F · AR & EVALUASI\nNomor 24–27","x":9600,"y":80,"width":1530,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"step-01","type":"text","text":"## 01 · PROSPEK / CUSTOMER AKTIF\n**PIC: Sales**\nCatat inbound atau lakukan outreach ke customer; simpan nama perusahaan, PIC, kebutuhan, dan follow-up.\n\n**Output:** Daftar prospek / aktivitas","x":400,"y":500,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"step-02","type":"text","text":"## 02 · TERIMA RFQ CUSTOMER\n**PIC: Sales**\nTerima permintaan barang, qty, target waktu, lokasi kirim, dan kontak requester.\n\n**Output:** RFQ tercatat","x":800,"y":500,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"step-03","type":"text","text":"## 03 · KLARIFIKASI SPESIFIKASI\n**PIC: Sales**\nKonfirmasi merek, tipe, dimensi, unit, foto/nameplate atau sampel; kumpulkan info yang kurang.\n\n**Output:** RFQ siap di-price","x":1200,"y":500,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"step-04","type":"text","text":"## 04 · MINTA HARGA SUPPLIER\n**PIC: Purchasing**\nKirim RFQ yang lengkap ke beberapa supplier bila memungkinkan.\n\n**Output:** Penawaran supplier","x":1600,"y":810,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"step-05","type":"text","text":"## 05 · BANDINGKAN PENAWARAN\n**PIC: Purchasing**\nBandingkan harga beli, stok, ongkir, lead time, MOQ, kualitas, dan termin; laporkan opsi.\n\n**Output:** Rekomendasi biaya / pemasok","x":2000,"y":810,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"step-06","type":"text","text":"## 06 · TETAPKAN HARGA JUAL\n**PIC: Owner**\nPeriksa biaya total, margin, kebutuhan modal, dan risiko; tetapkan harga jual/termin penawaran.\n\n**Output:** Approval harga jual","x":2400,"y":1120,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"step-07","type":"text","text":"## 07 · SUSUN QUOTATION\n**PIC: Admin**\nBuat penawaran dari harga yang disetujui; cek item, qty, unit, harga, PPN bila berlaku, masa berlaku, dan termin.\n\n**Output:** Quotation final","x":2800,"y":1430,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"step-08","type":"text","text":"## 08 · KIRIM QUOTATION\n**PIC: Sales**\nKirim dokumen penawaran final ke PIC customer dan catat tanggal kirim.\n\n**Output:** Bukti penawaran dikirim","x":3200,"y":500,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"step-09","type":"text","text":"## 09 · FOLLOW-UP & NEGOSIASI\n**PIC: Sales**\nCatat respons: diterima, revisi, pending, atau ditolak. Revisi harga kembali ke Owner jika perlu.\n\n**Output:** Status quotation / next action","x":3600,"y":500,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"step-10","type":"text","text":"## 10 · TERIMA CUSTOMER PO\n**PIC: Sales**\nMinta dan teruskan PO resmi; pastikan PO mengacu pada quotation yang disepakati.\n\n**Output:** Customer PO diterima","x":4000,"y":500,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"step-11","type":"text","text":"## 11 · VERIFIKASI CUSTOMER PO\n**PIC: Admin**\nCocokkan nomor PO, nama customer, barang, spec, qty, harga, termin, alamat, dan jadwal. Minta Sales perbaiki bila beda.\n\n**Output:** PO valid / catatan selisih","x":4400,"y":1430,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"step-12","type":"text","text":"## 12 · CATAT ORDER DI ERP\n**PIC: Admin**\nInput pesanan customer pada ERP internal; tautkan RFQ/quotation/PO dan jadwal kirim, sejauh fitur tersedia.\n\n**Output:** Order tercatat / status awal","x":4800,"y":1430,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"step-13","type":"text","text":"## 13 · CEK TERMIN & KAS\n**PIC: Finance**\nCatat termin customer dan kebutuhan dana; bila bayar sebelum kirim, tahan release sampai pembayaran terkonfirmasi.\n\n**Output:** Status kredit / dana order","x":5200,"y":1740,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"step-14","type":"text","text":"## 14 · CEK STOK & RENCANA\n**PIC: Purchasing**\nKonfirmasi barang sudah ada atau harus beli, serta tanggal siap kirim.\n\n**Output:** Rencana pemenuhan barang","x":5600,"y":810,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"step-15","type":"text","text":"## 15 · ORDER KE SUPPLIER\n**PIC: Purchasing**\nJika perlu beli, pilih pemasok dan lakukan pemesanan sesuai otorisasi yang berlaku. Catat harga/ETA.\n\n**Output:** PO supplier / bukti pemesanan","x":6000,"y":810,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"step-16","type":"text","text":"## 16 · PROSES DANA SUPPLIER\n**PIC: Finance**\nJika supplier perlu prepayment / top-up petty cash, cek dokumen dan proses dana menurut kewenangan internal.\n\n**Output:** Bukti pembayaran / dana siap","x":6400,"y":1740,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"step-17","type":"text","text":"## 17 · TERIMA & PERIKSA BARANG\n**PIC: Purchasing**\nCocokkan barang fisik dengan spesifikasi, qty, dan kondisi. Tangani barang salah/rusak sebelum kirim.\n\n**Output:** Barang siap kirim / catatan QC","x":6800,"y":810,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"step-18","type":"text","text":"## 18 · SIAPKAN SURAT JALAN\n**PIC: Admin**\nBuat SJ berdasar order dan qty yang benar-benar akan dikirim; serahkan untuk pengiriman.\n\n**Output:** SJ siap tanda tangan","x":7200,"y":1430,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"step-19","type":"text","text":"## 19 · ATUR & LAKUKAN KIRIM\n**PIC: Purchasing**\nKoordinasikan packing/driver/pengiriman dan pastikan customer menandatangani bukti terima.\n\n**Output:** Barang dikirim / SJ ditandatangani","x":7600,"y":810,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"step-20","type":"text","text":"## 20 · ARSIP BUKTI PENGIRIMAN\n**PIC: Admin**\nTerima SJ bertanda tangan; cocokkan qty aktual dan arsipkan scan/foto pada order.\n\n**Output:** SJ final / status kirim","x":8000,"y":1430,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"step-21","type":"text","text":"## 21 · TERBITKAN INVOICE & PAJAK\n**PIC: Admin**\nCocokkan customer PO + SJ bertanda tangan + qty aktual; buat invoice dan faktur pajak jika berlaku.\n\n**Output:** Invoice / faktur pajak","x":8400,"y":1430,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"step-22","type":"text","text":"## 22 · KIRIM PAKET TAGIHAN\n**PIC: Admin**\nKirim invoice beserta PO, SJ, dan dokumen yang diminta customer; catat tanggal dan penerima.\n\n**Output:** Bukti invoice diterima customer","x":8800,"y":1430,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"step-23","type":"text","text":"## 23 · CATAT PIUTANG & JATUH TEMPO\n**PIC: Finance**\nMasukkan nominal outstanding, termin, jatuh tempo, dan status dokumen pada catatan/ERP internal.\n\n**Output:** Daftar AR / aging piutang","x":9200,"y":1740,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"step-24","type":"text","text":"## 24 · FOLLOW-UP PENAGIHAN\n**PIC: Finance**\nPantau invoice belum lunas; hubungi PIC pembayaran, catat janji bayar dan eskalasi bila lewat jatuh tempo.\n\n**Output:** Log penagihan / janji bayar","x":9600,"y":1740,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"step-25","type":"text","text":"## 25 · VERIFIKASI DANA MASUK\n**PIC: Finance**\nCocokkan mutasi bank dengan nomor invoice dan nominal; telusuri kekurangan, potongan atau kelebihan.\n\n**Output:** Bukti pembayaran terverifikasi","x":10000,"y":1740,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"step-26","type":"text","text":"## 26 · UPDATE STATUS PIUTANG\n**PIC: Finance**\nCatat lunas/partial dan sisa tagihan di ERP internal; rekonsiliasi per customer.\n\n**Output:** AR updated / sisa outstanding","x":10400,"y":1740,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"step-27","type":"text","text":"## 27 · REVIEW ORDER & KINERJA\n**PIC: Owner**\nTinjau margin aktual, ketepatan supplier, kepatuhan dokumen dan umur piutang pada laporan berkala.\n\n**Output:** Action item perbaikan","x":10800,"y":1120,"width":330,"height":235,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"sales-ex","type":"text","text":"# SALES — RESPON CUSTOMER\n**PIC: Sales**\nJika spesifikasi belum jelas, minta foto/nameplate atau sampel sebelum Purchasing cari harga. Jika quotation ditolak, catat alasan dan jadwal follow-up. Jika minta revisi harga, kembalikan ke Owner.","x":500,"y":2330,"width":1400,"height":315,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"proc-ex","type":"text","text":"# PURCHASING — SUPPLIER BERMASALAH\n**PIC: Purchasing**\nJika supplier tidak tersedia, barang salah, atau ETA mundur, cari alternatif dan beri opsi ke Sales. Jangan mengganti merek/spec tanpa persetujuan customer.","x":1980,"y":2330,"width":1560,"height":315,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"owner-ex","type":"text","text":"# OWNER — PENGECUALIAN ORDER\n**PIC: Owner**\nUsulan kontrol: owner menyetujui pembelian sebelum PO customer, batas nilai pengeluaran, perubahan margin, dan pengiriman berisiko. Tetapkan siapa boleh menyetujui di SOP.","x":3620,"y":2330,"width":1560,"height":315,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"admin-ex","type":"text","text":"# ADMIN — PO BELUM ADA / KIRIM PARSIAL\n**PIC: Admin**\nKondisi yang pernah dibahas: barang bisa sudah dikirim sementara PO customer masih pending. Lacak order/SJ, tetapi jangan terbitkan invoice sebelum PO tersedia sesuai alur yang dibahas. Untuk parsial, tagih hanya qty aktual.","x":5260,"y":2330,"width":1900,"height":315,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"finance-ex","type":"text","text":"# FINANCE — PIUTANG BELUM LUNAS\n**PIC: Finance**\nJika lewat jatuh tempo, catat bukti follow-up dan janji bayar. Jika transfer parsial, sisa tagihan tetap outstanding sampai dilunasi atau ada dokumen koreksi yang sah.","x":7240,"y":2330,"width":1820,"height":315,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cash-ex","type":"text","text":"# FINANCE — BAYAR SEBELUM KIRIM\n**PIC: Finance**\nJika customer disepakati cash before delivery, konfirmasi dana benar-benar masuk sebelum barang dilepas. Jangan samakan bukti transfer yang dikirim customer dengan saldo bank terverifikasi.","x":9160,"y":2330,"width":1950,"height":315,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"support-1","type":"text","text":"## ATURAN SERAH TERIMA\nSales → Purchasing: RFQ lengkap.\nPurchasing → Owner: perbandingan harga + lead time.\nOwner → Admin: harga yang disetujui.\nAdmin → Sales: quotation final.\nSales → Admin: customer PO.\nAdmin → Purchasing: order valid / qty yang perlu dikirim.","x":400,"y":2810,"width":2580,"height":380,"color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"support-2","type":"text","text":"## DOKUMEN INTI DI ERP INTERNAL PPP\nRFQ → Penawaran supplier → Approval harga → Quotation → Customer PO → Catatan order → Bukti beli (jika ada) → SJ bertanda tangan → Invoice / faktur pajak bila berlaku → Pelunasan.\nGunakan menu/istilah sesuai ERP PPP yang benar-benar tersedia.","x":3070,"y":2810,"width":3120,"height":380,"color":"#438FBD"},
		{"id":"support-3","type":"text","text":"## CATATAN SOP YANG PERLU DIPUTUSKAN\nBatas approval Owner; pembelian/pengiriman tanpa PO; pembayaran supplier dan petty cash; syarat credit vs bayar di muka; PIC formal untuk kirim tagihan; langkah retur/koreksi; standar scan dokumen; indikator aging AR.\nSemua ini perlu disepakati sebelum dinyatakan prosedur wajib.","x":6280,"y":2810,"width":3120,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"support-4","type":"text","text":"## PERAN ≠ ORANG\nPembagian peran operasional yang dipetakan: Sales, Purchasing, Owner, Admin, Finance. Apabila saat ini Owner juga menjalankan Sales, cukup orang yang sama mengerjakan kotak kedua peran tersebut, tetapi **PIC setiap langkah tetap tunggal**.","x":9490,"y":2810,"width":1940,"height":380,"color":"#64748B"}
	],
